{"blocks": [{"bbox": [0.0, 0.0, 879.0, 695.0], "text": "", "type": "Page"}, {"bbox": [31.33154296875, 33.59619140625, 185.41571044921875, 45.16448974609375], "text": "YUSOF ISHAK HOUSE CommIT", "type": "SectionHeader"}, {"bbox": [33.90673828125, 46.8310546875, 195.61068725585938, 109.91497802734375], "text": "Yusof Ishak House, Level 3 Tucked away in a corner at the Yusof Ishak House, CommIT offers desktops, as well as printing and scanning facilities for students' use.", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [32.619140625, 124.8828125, 87.43569946289062, 136.16448974609375], "text": "THINKLAB", "type": "SectionHeader"}, {"bbox": [31.7607421875, 138.11767578125, 138.6418914794922, 148.51776123046875], "text": "Computer Centre, Level 3", "type": "SectionHeader"}, {"bbox": [32.619140625, 150.673828125, 197.8422393798828, 278.8909912109375], "text": "The first lab in NUS to provide a virtual desktop experience, ThinkLab is NUS IT's initiative to offer highly efficient computing using a fraction of the energy of traditional PCs. Equipped with virtual Windows desktops and iMacs, this lab runs 24/7 to provide a comfortable and quiet place for students to work. Printing services are also available.", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [31.7607421875, 293.203125, 98.28569030761719, 305.1643981933594], "text": "AS8 CommIT", "type": "SectionHeader"}, {"bbox": [32.18994140625, 306.0986328125, 82.90099334716797, 317.5176696777344], "text": "AS8, Level 2", "type": "SectionHeader"}, {"bbox": [31.7607421875, 316.9580078125, 192.58969116210938, 369.9149169921875], "text": "Centrally located near the Central Library, this centre houses computers for your computing needs. Printing services are also available here.", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [20.4921875, 366.266357421875, 422.44140625, 632.796142578125], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [205.74658203125, 16.62841796875, 860.38427734375, 326.79931640625], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [472.54833984375, 326.79931640625, 550.4657592773438